/*
 * Declares the InlineBlockValue class.
 *
 * InlineBlockValue represents an inline block, a construct similar to an
 * inline function body: control-flow “returns” inside the block do not exit
 * the surrounding frame but instead jump to the end of the inline block.
 *
 * Inline blocks:
 *   - group a sequence of generator values without introducing a scope,
 *   - are always considered reduced,
 *   - never yield lvalues,
 *   - aggregate throwers from their contained values,
 *   - do not track break/return locations(these never escape the block),
 *   - print using a compact `#INLINE { ... }` form.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::scope::inline
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/scope/inline.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-16
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
